        // The only way to get tokens is through mintSynth, which requires being a curated pool.
        // The curated pool check uses iPOOLFACTORY(_DAO().POOLFACTORY()).isCuratedPool(msg.sender).
        // We don't know the addresses.  So we cannot mint.
